[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0010","text":"咦，美琴\n怎么了，这个时间"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0020","text":"啊……制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0030","text":"房间里的空气\n感觉特别干燥"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0040","text":"是吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0050","text":"……嗯\n想着去买点喝的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0060","text":"是空调的原因吗\n你调过了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0070","text":"没有……空调啊\n回房间之后我看看"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0080","text":"……制作人也喝点什么吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0090","text":"啊，我来买吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0100","text":"……是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0110","text":"嗯，那边有自动贩卖机来着\n你要什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0120","text":"那我要水"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0130","text":"给，果穗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0140","text":"谢谢\n……我开动了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0150","text":"这种地方的自动贩卖机真贵啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0160","text":"是吗？\n那，钱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0170","text":"啊，不用了\n抱歉，我不是那个意思"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012500_01_0180","text":"……这样啊\n那我好好喝"}]
